@startuml platform-architecture
' ============================================================================
'  pc-agent Platform - target architecture (v2)
'  Local app + mandatory auth + E2E vault + 3 LLM tiers + control plane.
'  Render (from this folder):  java -jar ../../plantuml.jar -tpng platform-architecture.puml
' ============================================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #999999
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 13
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #888888
  roundCorner 12
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

title pc-agent Platform - Target Architecture (v2)\nMandatory login + local desktop app (shell + Python sidecar) + END-TO-END encrypted memory bank + 3 LLM tiers + control plane\nBackbone: Clean/Hexagonal (ports & adapters). green = exists in v2 today    amber = net-new for the platform

' ===========================================================================
' FRONT-ENDS
' ===========================================================================
package "FRONT-ENDS (component SPA + adapters -> one core)" #E8F0FE {
  rectangle "**Desktop shell** (Tauri/Electron)\nrenders the Web UI in a native window\n+ spawns the agentd sidecar.\nSigned installer (.exe/.msi/.dmg) + auto-update" as SHELL #DCEBFF
  rectangle "Web UI (React/Vue)\nsame code = web + desktop" as WEBUI #DCEBFF
  rectangle "Terminal\n(have it)" as TERM #DCEBFF
  rectangle "Messaging\nTelegram (pull) /\nWhatsApp,Slack (push->relay)" as MSG #DCEBFF
}

' ===========================================================================
' LOGIN GATE (mandatory)
' ===========================================================================
rectangle "**LOGIN GATE (mandatory)**\nregister/login before ANY use;\npassword -> Argon2 -> client key\n(key NEVER leaves the device)" as GATE #FFCDD2

' ===========================================================================
' LOCAL AGENT APP (user's machine)
' ===========================================================================
package "USER'S MACHINE - agentd (Python sidecar) - HEXAGONAL core + event loop" #E6F4EA {
  rectangle "**Ingress (channel adapter)**\nLOCAL SERVER on 127.0.0.1, token-gated\nmessage in -> stream out (chat.send)" as INGRESS #D4EDD9
  rectangle "**Agent loop**\nLLM <-> tools, continuation/verify\n(have it)" as LOOP #D4EDD9
  rectangle "**Policy / Guardrails** (tool chokepoint)\nauthorize each tool call:\nallow / deny / needs-approval\n+ Approval = human-in-the-loop (UI confirm)" as GUARD #FFE0B2
  rectangle "**Tools**: read write edit ls find exec\nprocess web_search web_fetch browser\n-> act on THIS PC (files, apps, browser)" as TOOLS #D4EDD9
  rectangle "**Skills** (local SKILL.md playbooks)\nloadable know-how, read on demand;\nadd your own (no code). pluggable:\nlocal folder now / cloud vault later" as SKILLS #D4EDD9
  rectangle "**Crypto / key store**\nencrypt before upload,\ndecrypt after download\n(holds the only key)" as CRYPTO #FFE0B2
  rectangle "**Memory client (sync / cache)**\nrecall runs HERE on plaintext;\nencrypts to the Memory Bank.\npluggable: local now / cloud later" as MEM #FFE0B2
  rectangle "**Inference adapter (stream_fn)**\npicks the LLM tier by config" as INFER #D4EDD9
}

' ===========================================================================
' LLM TIERS (privacy differs)
' ===========================================================================
package "LLM - three tiers (privacy differs by tier)" #FFF4E5 {
  rectangle "**Local model** (Ollama)\nplaintext never leaves device\nPRIVATE" as LLM_LOCAL #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**Sovereign**: user's own server\nopen model on their infra\nPRIVATE" as LLM_SOV #FFE0B2
  rectangle "**Managed secure**: YOUR GPU VM\nopen model, stateless, NON-LOGGING\nsees plaintext only in RAM, forgets it\nPRIVATE (no third party)" as LLM_VM #FFD699
  rectangle "**BYOK**: OpenAI/Gemini/Anthropic API\n!! data goes to that vendor !!\nNOT private from them" as LLM_BYOK #FFCDD2
}

' ===========================================================================
' CONTROL PLANE (your cloud) - metadata + ciphertext only
' ===========================================================================
package "YOUR CLOUD - Control Plane (modular monolith, layered-clean; metadata + CIPHERTEXT only)" #FDECEA {
  rectangle "**Accounts & Auth**\nlogin -> short-lived signed token\n+ entitlements (tier/quota)\n(gates LLM gateway + Vault)" as AUTH #FBD9D4
  rectangle "**Memory Bank (canonical, E2E)**\nhistory + profile + learned + index;\nCIPHERTEXT + wrapped key only (can't read it).\nSwappable backend: DB / vector / their server" as VAULT #FBD9D4
  rectangle "**Usage monitoring + Admin**\nper-user usage/status (metadata)\nbilling-ready; not charged in v2" as ADMIN #FBD9D4
  rectangle "**LLM gateway**\nverify token + quota + meter,\nthen forward to the secure model" as LLMGW #FBD9D4
  rectangle "**Message relay**\npush webhook -> app connection" as RELAY #FBD9D4
}

rectangle "**Admin (you)**\nmonitor users (metadata only)" as ADMINUSER #F5F5F5

' ===========================================================================
' EDGES
' ===========================================================================
SHELL --> WEBUI : renders
SHELL ..> INGRESS : spawns sidecar
WEBUI --> GATE
TERM --> GATE
MSG --> GATE
GATE --> INGRESS : after login - localhost WS\n127.0.0.1, token-gated (in)

INGRESS --> LOOP
LOOP --> GUARD : every tool call
GUARD --> TOOLS : if allowed/approved
LOOP --> SKILLS : advertise one-liners +\nread playbook on demand
LOOP --> MEM
MEM --> CRYPTO
LOOP --> INFER

INFER --> LLM_LOCAL : tier=local
INFER --> LLM_SOV : tier=sovereign
INFER --> LLM_VM : tier=managed (via gateway)
INFER --> LLM_BYOK : tier=byok

' app -> control plane : ALL OUTBOUND (agentd dials out; server never connects in)
GATE ..> AUTH : OUT: login / token / entitlements
CRYPTO ..> VAULT : OUT: sync CIPHERTEXT
LOOP ..> ADMIN : OUT: report usage (metadata)
INGRESS <.. RELAY : push DOWN the outbound link
LLM_VM <.. LLMGW : token-gated, metered
LLMGW ..> AUTH : verify token
ADMINUSER --> ADMIN

note as ENOTE #FFF8DC
  MEMORY = pluggable subsystem (not just chat):
  history + profile + learned facts + recall index.
  One interface; swap the backend anytime
  (local now -> cloud bank later -> their server).
  Canonical copy in the cloud (cross-device);
  local is a sync/cache. E2E at rest: server holds
  ciphertext + wrapped key only, cannot read it.
end note
ENOTE .. VAULT

note as TNOTE #E8F5E9
  TRANSPORT / EXPOSURE - agentd has two roles:
  - LOCAL SERVER: 127.0.0.1 WebSocket for the UI,
    token-gated (free-port handshake from the shell).
  - OUTBOUND CLIENT: dials the control plane + LLM.
  The server NEVER connects in (machine behind NAT,
  no public port); pushes ride the outbound link.
end note
TNOTE .. INGRESS

note as PNOTE #E3F2FD
  PLAINTEXT boundary by tier:
  - local / sovereign : plaintext NEVER leaves the user's control
  - managed secure    : your stateless model sees plaintext only in RAM
                        during inference (not stored, not logged)
  - BYOK              : plaintext goes to a third-party AI vendor
  Vault storage is always ciphertext; only YOU (first-party) host the secure tier.
end note
PNOTE .. LLM_VM

legend left
  | Color | Meaning |
  | green | exists in v2 today |
  | amber | net-new for the platform |
  | red   | privacy warning / mandatory gate |
endlegend

@enduml
